```console
$ scherzo-cloud service-principal credential --help
Manage service API credentials

Usage: scherzo-cloud service-principal credential [COMMAND]

Commands:
  issue   Issue a service credential
  list    List active service credentials
  revoke  Revoke a service credential
  help    Print this message or the help of the given subcommand(s)

Options:
  -h, --help  Print help

```
